--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream benchmarks
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This artifact reports multi-agent trajectories run on problems drawn from the
benchmarks below. Each benchmark remains subject to its own license.

The problem manifests in experiments/ (manifest_omnimath2_n*.json) contain
the text and reference answers of the sampled Omni-MATH-2 problems,
redistributed under Apache-2.0 so that a run can be reproduced from the exact
inputs. Released trajectory rows identify problems by problem_uid, which
joins to the upstream releases.

* Omni-MATH-2 - https://huggingface.co/datasets/martheballon/Omni-MATH-2
  License: Apache-2.0.
  1,600 competition-mathematics problems sampled from a filtered pool of 4,181.

* SciBench - https://huggingface.co/datasets/xw27/scibench
  License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 Xiaoxuan Wang (see the upstream
  repository's LICENSE file). The complete 574-problem text-only
  free-response slice.

Please cite the original benchmark authors when using these identifiers.
